WEBVTT

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:13.939
<v Sarah Okafor>Morning, everyone. Monday the eighth of June. Hope your weekend plans survived the weather. Mine mostly involved standing under a gazebo pretending it wasn't raining.</v>

