00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:28.569
<v Aisha Begum>Sorry, talking over you—came all the way back, rather than sitting a bit low?</v>

00:01:29.609 --> 00:01:35.209
<v Grace Liu>Yeah, back on its own. Just passing on what I saw, not raising a new job.</v>

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.890
<v Tomasz Nowak>And I still can't get to the GT1 Compressor Section until production gives us a window.</v>

00:01:44.189 --> 00:01:48.390
<v Callum Reid>There isn't a window available at the moment. That's still the blocker.</v>

00:01:49.189 --> 00:01:53.040
<v Sarah Okafor>Understood. Blocked, then, not something we're agreeing to get done today.</v>

00:01:54.099 --> 00:01:58.650
