00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:15.300
<v Grace Liu>Exactly. The lock-out tag-out sign-off, that's what I'm taking.</v>

00:03:15.969 --> 00:03:22.969
<v Sarah Okafor>Marcus, the plant-side one for you: grease and check the bearings on the boiler feed pump. Monday, please. Fairly important.</v>

00:03:24.599 --> 00:03:31.599
<v Marcus Hale>Yeah, that I can take. I'll grease and check the bearings on the boiler feed pump Monday. Understood, fairly important.</v>

00:03:33.449 --> 00:03:37.650
<v Aisha Begum>Sorry, audio clipped for a second. That was the boiler feed pump?</v>

00:03:38.289 --> 00:03:41.439
<v Marcus Hale>The boiler feed pump, yes. Bearings, grease and check.</v>

00:03:42.629 --> 00:03:53.129
<v Grace Liu>While we're on permits, I'll sort the permit to work and isolation for the GT2 next Tuesday. Not an emergency but don't let it slip—that's how I'm treating that one.</v>

