<v Marcus Hale>I'll clear the jam and check the sensors on the line 2 robot next Tuesday.</v>

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:49.860
<v Sarah Okafor>Thanks, Marcus Hale. Both clearing the jam and checking the sensors on the line 2 robot, next Tuesday.</v>

00:04:51.889 --> 00:04:54.689
<v Marcus Hale>Yeah, I'll take the whole of that one.</v>

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:01.399
<v Aisha Begum>Good, I nearly heard that as just clearing it. Sensors as well, then.</v>

