<v Marcus Hale>Sensors as well. That's what I've agreed.</v>

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:12.069
<v Sarah Okafor>Tomasz, can you check the guarding on the Palletiser on Friday? Top priority please.</v>

00:05:13.199 --> 00:05:17.750
<v Tomasz Nowak>Yes, I'll check the guarding on the Palletiser on Friday. Top priority, understood.</v>

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:23.329
<v Callum Reid>Sorry, Friday still stands? Heard 'top priority' and thought you were bringing it forward.</v>

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:30.269
<v Sarah Okafor>No, on Friday is still the timing. Top priority please, but I'm not changing the day.</v>

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.079
